          "page": 3,
          "section": "Experimental Method",
          "quote": "The experiment is divided into the following four key steps: (1) Pre-oxidation: The initial as-cast cylindrical FGH96 alloy ingots were heated at 500 °C for 30 minutes to form oxide film on their surface. (2) Sintering: Two ingots with flat oxide-coated surfaces contacted were bonded together by Spark Plasma Sintering (SPS) at 50 MPa and 1000 °C for 10 minutes.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": "1",
          "chunk_id": "5b228f8d9a3370f6:part:001"
        }
      ]
